中PCIe端口节点的配置不正确，导致dtc警告和运行时警告出现，可能影响系统的稳定性和正确性。目前没有详细的漏洞细节提供。","cnImpact":"Linux Kernel   ;   ","cnPatch":"Linux kernel存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01702）的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/651931","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-56785","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01575f2ff8ba578a3436f230668bd056dc2eb823","cnTitle":"Linux kernel存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01702）","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01702","cnvdId":"CNVD-2025-01702","createdTime":1737043200000,"cveId":"CVE-2024-56785","hazardLevel":"中","id":30250,"pubDate":1737043200000,"updatedTime":1737043200000}},{"tags":[],"vulnerabilityEntity":{"cnDescribe":"Huawei HarmonyOS是中国华为（Huawei）公司的一个操作系统。提供一个基于微内核的全场景分布式操作系统。Huawei HarmonyOS存在安全漏洞，攻击者可利用该漏洞可能导致可用性受影响。","cnImpact":"Huawei HarmonyOS 5.0.0   ;   ","cnPatch":"Huawei HarmonyOS存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01701）的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/652061","cnReference":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-56446","cnSolution":"厂商已发布了漏洞修复程序，请及时关注更新：https://consumer.huawei.com/cn/support/bulletin/2025/1/","cnTitle":"Huawei HarmonyOS存在未明漏洞（CNVD-2025-01701）","cnTypes":"通用型漏洞","cnUrl":"https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2025-01701","cnvdId":"CNVD-2025-01701","createdTime":1737043200000,"cveId":"CVE-2024-56446","hazardLevel":"高","id":30249,"pubDate":1737043200000,"updatedTime":1737043200000}},{"tags":[],"vulnerabilityEntity":{"cnDescribe":"Siveillance Video（以前称为Siveillance VMS）是一款功能强大的IP视频管理软件，专为从小型简单到大规模和高安全性的部署而设计。Siveillance Video系列产品组合包括四个版本：Siveillance Video Core、Core Plus、Advanced和Pro，可满足从中小型解决方案到大型复杂部署的特定需求。Siemens Siveillance Video摄像机驱动程序存在信息泄露漏洞，本地攻击者可利用漏洞在特定条件下读取存储在Recording Server中的摄像机凭据。","cnImpact":"Siemens Siveillance Video Device Pack <V13.5   ;   ","cnPatch":"Siemens Siveillance Video摄像机驱动程序信息泄露漏洞的补丁:http://www.cnvd.org.cn/patchInfo/show/651896","cnReference":"https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-404759.html","cnSolution":"厂商已发布升级版本修复漏洞，请广大用户及时下载更新至V1